stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    state "草稿" as Draft
    state "待确认" as Pending
    state "执行中" as Active
    state "已完成" as Done
    state "已归档" as Archived

    [*] --> Draft: 生成计划草案
    Draft --> Pending: 校验通过 / 存在冲突
    Pending --> Draft: 修改约束后重新生成
    Pending --> Active: 学生确认（生成 v1）
    Active --> Active: 打卡记录进度
    Active --> Done: 任务全部完成或超过截止日期
    Active --> Archived: 调整生效（旧版本归档）
    Archived --> [*]
    Done --> [*]
